@startuml
 title TaskFlow API — Task Request Activity
 start
 :Client sends a task request with a bearer token;
 if (JWT valid?) then (yes)
   :TaskController validates the request (and body when present);
   :TaskService checks visibility and operation permissions;
   if (Operation allowed?) then (yes)
     :Read or write through repositories;
     :Return JSON response;
   else (no)
     :Return API access error;
   endif
 else (no)
   :Return 401 Unauthorized;
 endif
 stop
@enduml
